
# ==========================================================
# TH7 - KIEM THU BAO MAT WEBSITE STYLEHUB - NHOM 10
# Cong cu: REST Client (VS Code)
# Chi kiem thu tren localhost cua nhom
#
# LUU Y:
# - Khong luu cookie phien, mat khau hoac CSRF token that.
# - Cac request POST co CSRF hop le can lay cookie/token
#   trong phien hien tai va dien vao bien tam khi thu.
# ==========================================================

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### 01 - Header bao mat (mong doi 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: text/html

### 02 - GET trang ca nhan Son (mong doi 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/thanhvien/3120224123_son/gioithieu.php

### 03 - POST dang nhap thieu CSRF (mong doi 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/dang-nhap.php
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

email=test@example.com&mat_khau=matkhau_sai

### 04 - POST dang nhap sai CSRF (mong doi 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/dang-nhap.php
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

email=test@example.com&mat_khau=matkhau_sai&csrf_token=abc

### 05 - POST CSRF dang mang (mong doi 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/dang-nhap.php
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

email=test@example.com&mat_khau=x&csrf_token[]=abc

### 06 - GET dang xuat (mong doi 405)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dang-xuat.php

### 07 - Truy cap quan tri khi chua dang nhap
# Mong doi 302 chuyen sang dang-nhap.php
GET {{baseUrl}}/quan-tri.php

### 08 - Kiem tra tham so mang danh sach
# Mong doi khong co HTTP 500/Warning
GET {{baseUrl}}/danh-sach.php?q%5B%5D=ao

### 09 - Kiem tra tham so mang chi tiet
# Mong doi khong co HTTP 500/Warning
GET {{baseUrl}}/chi-tiet.php?id%5B%5D=1

### 10 - Kiem tra tham so mang trang Son
# Mong doi khong co HTTP 500/Warning
GET {{baseUrl}}/thanhvien/3120224123_son/gioithieu.php?diem_tu%5B%5D=10

### 11 - Truy cap file Composer noi bo (mong doi 403/404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/composer.json

### 12 - Truy cap file SQL noi bo (mong doi 403/404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/database/schema.sql

### 13 - Truy cap file .git (mong doi 403/404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/.git/config

### 14 - Truy cap file log (mong doi 403/404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/logs/bao-mat.log

### 15 - Truy cap vendor (mong doi 403/404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/vendor/autoload.php

### 16 - POST lich hen Son thieu CSRF (mong doi 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/thanhvien/3120224123_son/gioithieu.php
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

hanh_dong=lich_hen&hoTen=Nguyen+Van+Test&ngay=2026-12-12&gio=14%3A00&noiDung=Kiem+thu+CSRF+TH7

### 17 - POST trac nghiem Son thieu CSRF (mong doi 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/thanhvien/3120224123_son/gioithieu.php
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

hanh_dong=trac_nghiem&bi_danh=Test

### 18 - API gio hang thieu CSRF (mong doi 403 JSON)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/gio-hang.php
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"id":1,"so_luong":1}

### 19 - Kiem tra file CSS hop le (mong doi 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/css/style.css

### 20 - Kiem tra JavaScript hop le (mong doi 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/js/gio-hang.js

# ==========================================================
# CAN KIEM THU BO SUNG BANG TRINH DUYET / CURL:
# - POST co CSRF dung va cookie phien hop le.
# - Quyen cua khach khi xoa san pham.
# - Session fixation, session timeout.
# - XSS va CSP trong Console.
# - Gioi han dang nhap 5 lan / 15 phut.
# - DROP/CREATE bang tai khoan stylehub_app.
# - .htaccess tren Apache XAMPP.
# ==========================================================
